OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a dry start rain will
OL,6,Fspread northeast by late morning. Then
OL,7,Fthis afternoon will be cloudy with
OL,8,Frain, occasionally heavy. Windy with
OL,9,Fstrong, occasionally gale force,
OL,10,Fsoutherly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRain, heavy at times, will
OL,13,Fclear from the southwest this evening.
OL,14,FThen the rest of the night will see
OL,15,Fclear periods and the odd passing
OL,16,Fshower. Strong winds easing down.
OL,17,
OL,18,CMonday:FChance of a few showers at
OL,19,Ffirst otherwise it will be mainly dry
OL,20,Fwith some sunny intervals.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
