OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FDry
OL,6,Fon Tuesday with strong southeasterly
OL,7,Fwinds, gales later. Windy with rain
OL,8,Fspreading northeast on Wednesday. Dry
OL,9,Fand bright on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
